Odin
====

Odin, Copyright (c) 2026 Réda Chérif-Touil
Released under the GPL v3 License, see the LICENSE file.

Odin is a low-level emulator of the SEGA Hikaru arcade board: it runs the
programs of the real chips wherever they are known, and draws the games with
OpenGL.


GAMES
=====

The games of odin-games.json, by the names of their MAME sets:

 airtrix   Air Trix
 braveff   Brave Firefighters
 pharrier  Planet Harriers
 podrace   Star Wars Racer Arcade
 sgnascar  NASCAR Arcade
 von4      Cyber Troopers Virtual-On Force


STATUS
======

A work in progress. The six games run from power-on through their attract
loops, and what each one keeps without power (its settings, its records,
the clock) is kept between runs. Gamepads, wheels, light guns and force
feedback are being written: until then the keyboard is the control panel
(see INSTALL). TODO lists what is missing and what is guessed.


FILES
=====

 INSTALL    building and running
 CODING.md  how the code is written
 TODO       what is missing, and what is guessed (HEURISTIC)


